(and subsequent distribution of the hay. If new machinery were to be) Tj T*
(introduced, the Russian community would combine at once the advantages) Tj T*
(of a large concern, and those of having each individual worker) Tj T*
(directly interested in his work. This latter, it is claimed, is the) Tj T*
(characteristic feature of small farm holding. Having thus proved the) Tj T*
(superiority of Russian communism in land, judged from the standpoint of) Tj T*
(individual utility, Tchernyshefsky goes on to the other very important) Tj T*
(question:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(?Is it possible for Russia to leap over one phase of her historical) Tj T*
(development? _Natura non agit per saltus._?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To answer this question he quoted the history of technical progress.) Tj T*
(There was a time when our forefathers produced fire by rubbing together) Tj T*
