(and consumption, is now, I imagine, universally recognized as the) Tj T*
(primitive form of social life. It is only during the higher stages of) Tj T*
(development that private ownership by individuals comes into existence;) Tj T*
(and private property in land was the latest to appear on the historical) Tj T*
(scene. The dissolution of the land community in Western Europe is a) Tj T*
(fact of comparatively very recent date. In Russia, where the process) Tj T*
(of evolution has been less rapid, we see this primeval institution) Tj T*
(preserved until to-day.) Tj T*
