(Still, side by side with agrarian communism, we meet with that peculiar) Tj T*
(form of hereditary tenure known as ?quarterly? \(_tschetvertnoye_\)) Tj T*
(possession.[17] The difference between agrarian communism and quarterly) Tj T*
(possession consists in the fact that under the former, the plots are) Tj T*
(fixed by the _mir_, whereas under the latter they are fixed through) Tj T*
(inheritance, gift, etc. Yet it is not the land itself, but some ideal) Tj T*
