(meadow are in the possession of the community. The forest and the) Tj T*
(meadow are redivided yearly. The villages differ as to the standard of) Tj T*
(subdivision: in some of them the lots of the peasants are proportioned) Tj T*
(to the size of the inherited lots of arable land, in some they are) Tj T*
(equal. The pasture is used in common.) Tj T*
