(of the government in regard to this class tended to bring them down to) Tj T*
(the level of the peasantry. Alienability of land was obviously opposed) Tj T*
(to these views of the government, since thereby many members of this) Tj T*
(class became landless. The attempt was therefore made to put a stop) Tj T*
(to it by a series of ukases forbidding the sale of lands belonging to) Tj T*
(the _odnodvortzy_. To insure obedience to its ukases the government,) Tj T*
