(ordered that land should henceforth be measured for the entire village) Tj T*
(in one tract, and not in individual parcels to every householder, as) Tj T*
(had been previously done; and at the same time the alienation of lots) Tj T*
(was forbidden. Thus the community was entrusted with the subdivision of) Tj T*
(the land among its members. The distribution was based originally upon) Tj T*
(the dimensions of individual possession of former times. It generally) Tj T*
