(The Russian village community, as has been stated above, was a) Tj T*
(compound integer of which the unit was the communistic household.) Tj T*
(The individualistic tendency of the economic evolution after the) Tj T*
(emancipation did not fail to affect this cell of archaic communism. The) Tj T*
(dissolution of the compound family became the evil of the day within) Tj T*
(the village, and the most warmly discussed topic both in literature) Tj T*
(and in administrative circles. The peasantist regarded the decline of) Tj T*
(the ?pillars?[94] of Archaic communism with the deepest regret. ?_O) Tj T*
(tempora, o mores!_? clamored the bureaucrat, indignant at the spirit) Tj T*
(of ?disobedience to the elder? which was permeating the village. Of) Tj T*
(greater importance, perhaps, was the perfectly justified apprehension) Tj T*
(as to whether the dissolution of the peasant family might not have) Tj T*
(an injurious effect upon the taxpaying power of the household. It) Tj T*
(might be questioned by individualists whether the peasant, as a human) Tj T*
(being, was necessarily to be guided in his domestic life solely by) Tj T*
(regard for the public purse, but from the standpoint of Russian public) Tj T*
(law, such objections do not hold water. To use an analogy, the stock) Tj T*
(farmer, when mating his animals, does not take in consideration the) Tj T*
(possible condition of their mutual affection, his object being solely) Tj T*
(the maintenance and improvement of the breed. Is not the wise ruler) Tj T*
(the shepherd of his human flock? Thus about 1885[95] a law was passed) Tj T*
(forbidding the ?self-willed? division of the compound family without) Tj T*
(due authorization by the village assembly, whose resolutions are) Tj T*
