(In 1858 the average family had from two to three adult male workers) Tj T*
(above the age of 18, while in 1882 it had only from one to two male) Tj T*
(workers. This shows that before the emancipation the compound family,) Tj T*
(consisting either of the father and his married sons, or of married) Tj T*
(brothers, was the rule. To-day the typical family is represented either) Tj T*
(by a young couple with little children, or by the father and his boys) Tj T*
(below 18, who are counted only as ?half-workers,? or finally by the) Tj T*
(father and one of his adult sons. In all, the family has decreased) Tj T*
(by from three to four persons. It points out plainly that separation) Tj T*
(of the younger couple from the old stock is already an accomplished) Tj T*
(fact.[99] That this individualistic tendency develops as outside jobs) Tj T*
(gain in importance in the household economy is shown by the following) Tj T*
(figures:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
