() Tj T*
(_Ad III._ The rural proletariat is generally marked by the absence of) Tj T*
(live stock to till the land with.[121] The class in question is formed) Tj T*
(of those peasants whom it did not pay to work on their farms, in view) Tj T*
(of the scarcity of the same.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Nearly one-half of the class are landless or own less than five) Tj T*
(dessiatines, the percentage of such households being three times) Tj T*
(greater than among the peasantry at large. Only a very small minority) Tj T*
(are in the possession of plots exceeding the average, the percentage) Tj T*
(being three times less than among the peasants at large. On the whole,) Tj T*
(a holding of a proletarian is half the average in the district.[122]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is the immediate result of the complete dissolution of the) Tj T*
(patriarchal family among the village proletariat, the bulk of the) Tj T*
(latter consisting of families with only one adult male worker.[123]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Having failed as farmers, one-half have become farm laborers, the rest) Tj T*
(are employed in industry, or have no steady employment at all.[124]) Tj T*
(With all of them, wages are the chief means of livelihood.[125] The) Tj T*
(income from their farms is of secondary importance. The gross receipts) Tj T*
(from sale of produce are absorbed by the taxes.[126] Still the produce) Tj T*
(of the farm is partly consumed in kind and may serve to supply the) Tj T*
(owner with some of the necessaries of life.[127] In fact, it proves) Tj T*
(profitable for the village proletarian to cultivate his plot with the) Tj T*
(help of hired labor; accordingly, the majority of the proletarians of) Tj T*
(the Russian villages are not only employees, but also employers at the) Tj T*
(same time.[128] As yet there is but a small fraction of the village) Tj T*
(that has evolved into the condition of proletarians proper, whose only) Tj T*
(economic interest is that of wage labor.[129]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Ad II._ The mean between both extremes, _i. e._ between the) Tj T*
(independent farmers and the proletarian laborers, is occupied by a) Tj T*
(transitional class who are farmers and wage laborers at once.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
