(We find a clue to the coming development of the village in the fact) Tj T*
(that the main classes within the peasantry correspond to the age of the) Tj T*
(householders.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is but the minority of old-fashioned compound families that have) Tj T*
(stood their ground as virtual farmers; the middle economic group of the) Tj T*
(village, is formed by ?the middlers? _i. e._ the householders of middle) Tj T*
(age, who count in their families half-workers or one adult worker) Tj T*
(besides themselves. The proletarians are recruited from among the) Tj T*
(youngest generations, who consist of husband and wife with their little) Tj T*
(children.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
