(Industrial proletarians are steadily carried away by the growing) Tj T*
(movement out of the rural districts. Thus it may be reasonably assumed) Tj T*
(that only one-half of the pure-blooded proletarians remain in the) Tj T*
(village. This constitutes from 2 to 8 per cent. of the population.) Tj T*
(Relative rates, however, are sometimes misleading without reference to) Tj T*
(the absolute numbers. 2 per cent. of a 100-million population convey) Tj T*
(the illusion of a two million strong rural proletariat with pronounced) Tj T*
(class interests. Still we know that they are dissipated in villages) Tj T*
(with an average inhabitancy of 62 households \(_cf._ above page: 50,429) Tj T*
(communes with 3,309,020 households\). Now the maximum 8 per cent. of 62) Tj T*
(households means only 5 proletarian families, and the minimum 2 per) Tj T*
(cent., only 1 proletarian of the European type to a village. It seems) Tj T*
(to show that there can be no proletarian class spirit \(?_proletarisches) Tj T*
(Klassen-bewusstsein_?\) in the Russian village of to-day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
